  "_comment": [
    "Keys whose translation a human wrote or checked. `--overwrite` skips",
    "every one of them.",
    "",
    "es and pt are the markets with paying users, and their files were",
    "written by hand for that reason. A blanket regeneration would trade",
    "them for machine output that gets short UI labels wrong, which is most",
    "of a launcher.",
    "",
    "Add a locale here once somebody has actually read it. An entry is a",
    "claim that a person looked, not that the file exists."
